+## June 10 binder email: plans and attachment reference
 
-The analysis uses the specified sections of two public reader responses and the Indiana University guide. It checks displayed dates, excerpts, and inventory associations, with no native emails, private case correspondence, or physical binders inspected. [Source pins and exact locators](SOURCE-PINS.json)
